@host = http://localhost:5080

### Ingestion health — run this first after `docker compose up`
GET {{host}}/api/notices/stats

### List the most recently published notices
GET {{host}}/api/notices?take=20

### Only notices whose submission deadline is still open
GET {{host}}/api/notices?openOnly=true&take=20

### Filter by CPV code (software services)
GET {{host}}/api/notices?cpv=72000000&take=20

### Single notice, including the raw payload
GET {{host}}/api/notices/REPLACE_WITH_A_REAL_ID

### OpenAPI document (development only)
GET {{host}}/openapi/v1.json
